OL,3,AScammers demand ransoms from Instagram
OL,4,Ausers over fake copyright claims
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We understand this can be frustrating
OL,7,Ffor those impacted, and our systems are
OL,8,Fdesigned to protect people from this
OL,9,Fhappening in the first place," a Meta
OL,10,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
