OL,3,AOpenAI chief scientist warns no-one is
OL,4,Aprepared for consequences of AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI's chief scientist Jakub Pachocki
OL,7,Fhas called for "extreme caution" over
OL,8,FAI's runaway progress and warned more
OL,9,Fintervention may be needed to ensure
OL,10,F"humans remain in control of the
OL,11,Ffuture".
OL,13,F"I am concerned no one is prepared for
OL,14,Fthe consequences of a continued rapid
OL,15,Frise in machine intelligence," he wrote
OL,16,Fin a blog post entitled "An Alien
OL,17,FMind".
OL,19,FThe post comes only a few days after
OL,20,Fthe ChatGPT-maker released its latest
OL,21,Fmodel GPT-6 Astra, which it called its
OL,22,Fmost powerful product ever.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
