OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANigella praised as new Bake Off judge
OL,4,Aas latest contestants announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Times said that "lashings of
OL,7,FNigella Lawson help everyone rise to
OL,8,Fthe occasion", while the Telegraph
OL,9,Fdeclared "she is more delectable than
OL,10,Fanything the contestants could whip up
OL,11,Fin a showstopper challenge".
OL,13,FContestants for the 17th series have
OL,14,Falso been confirmed, including a
OL,15,Fpaediatric doctor, a competitive
OL,16,Fsprinter, a hairdresser and a drag
OL,17,Fartist.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
