OL,3,AMonty Don to leave Gardeners' World
OL,4,Aafter more than 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC said Don had "inspired and
OL,7,Fguided millions of viewers with his
OL,8,Fwarmth, wisdom and passion for
OL,9,Fgardening" since joining the programme
OL,10,Fin 2003.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
