OL,3,AMacklemore says 'Free Palestine' call
OL,4,Awas not an attack on Jewish people
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Macklemore has said his recent
OL,7,Fcalls to "Free Palestine" while on tour
OL,8,Fwith singer Ed Sheeran in the US were
OL,9,Fnot intended as an attack on Jewish
OL,10,Fpeople.
OL,12,FThere had been calls for the
OL,13,F43-year-old to be removed from
OL,14,FSheeran's tour after he made the
OL,15,Fcomments while supporting the singer at
OL,16,Ftwo live dates in New Jersey over the
OL,17,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788886107
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMacklemore says 'Free Palestine' call
OL,4,Awas not an attack on Jewish people
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a video posted on his social media
OL,7,Fchannels on Monday, Macklemore was seen
OL,8,Fon stage saying: "To all of my Jewish
OL,9,Fbrothers and sisters: Criticism of
OL,10,FIsrael, criticism of apartheid, being
OL,11,Fagainst genocide, is in no way a
OL,12,Fcriticism of you."
OL,14,FIsrael rejects allegations of genocide.
OL,15,FIt says its troops conduct self-defence
OL,16,Foperations in Gaza and the occupied
OL,17,FWest Bank in accordance with
OL,18,Finternational law.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
